## adapters — worker spec shape + glue copy + capability rows

$ cargo test -p oxide-fw-adapters --lib
test result: ok. 31 passed; 0 failed

cloudflare_emits_complete_worker_package: worker contains `init(env.EDGE)`,
`applyRules(`, `matchRoute(`, `env.OXIDE_KV.put`, `expirationTtl: 60`,
`indexTags`; handler.js loader `await import("./edge.js")` (the glue), not
`./edge.wasm`.
cloudflare_ships_glue_alongside_wasm_when_present: edge.wasm + edge.js +
handler.js + worker.js all copied; wrangler `[wasm_modules] edge = "./edge.wasm"`.
edge_capability_rows_are_truthful_per_e09: Cloudflare Live=Unsupported,
RustFns=Unsupported, Search=Unsupported, Skew=Degraded.

